sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant F as Frontend (React)
  participant B as Backend (Flask)
  participant S as Storage (uploads/)
  participant Y as Summary Service
  participant M as Local Model/NLP

  U->>F: Select file & click Upload
  F->>B: POST /upload (multipart/form-data)
  B->>S: Save file to backend/uploads
  S-->>B: Success
  par async
    B->>Y: summarize(fileId)
    Y->>S: load(fileId)
    S-->>Y: text
    Y->>M: extract/abstract(text)
    M-->>Y: summary
    Y-->>B: summary payload
  and
    B-->>F: 200 OK { message }
  end
  F-->>U: Show notification (upload success)
  F->>B: GET /summary/:id (polling or SSE in future)
  B-->>F: 200 OK { summary }
  F-->>U: Render summary in UI

